  "title": "Chocolate Plum Pudding Cake",
  "description": "This is a bit of an unusual cake, but great for Christmas. The chocolate mixed with raisins, applesauce, and spices gives a nice texture with a lot less work than plum pudding itself.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol"
  ],
